# Exam track — Theme: Gesond Liewen — Sub-lesson 2: Key Phrases
# Plain @sentence blocks (no @question) — shorter restatements of the same
# interview facts that sub-lesson 3 answers in full.
#
# These are Sergii's and his wife's real answers, gathered by interview — do not
# "improve" or genericize them in a later editing pass.
#
# This file owns SPORT, MOVEMENT and SLEEP. Food and drink are taught in
# sub-lesson 1; illness, childhood and the opinion block in sub-lesson 3.
#
# LOD corrections applied: Kendo has no LOD entry (kept as a proper noun, it is
# the real sport), Fussballsteam -> d'Fussballekipp, Fitnessstudio (not
# Fitnesssall), Bewegung -> d'Beweegung, recommendéieren -> recommandéieren,
# Sportsaart -> d'Sportaart.

@lesson G1.02 "Healthy Living Phrases"

@word de Sport = the sport
@word d'Sportaart = the kind of sport
@word de Kampfsport = the martial art
@word de Fussball = the football
@word d'Ekipp = the team
@word d'Fussballekipp = the football team
@word de Veräin = the club
@word de Sportsclub = the sports club
@word d'Schoulklass = the school class
@word de Fitnessstudio = the gym
