@word d'Zäit = the time
@word de Weekend = the weekend
@word d'Woch = the week
@word de Moment = the moment
@word d'Mol = the occasion
@word spadséieren = to go for a walk
@word spillen = to play
@word fueren = to ride
@word schwammen = to swim
@word fechten = to fence
@word trainéieren = to train
@word lauschteren = to listen
@word kucken = to watch
@word beweegen = to move
